{
    "about": "Casket rewards (src/clues/index.js rollCasket). Each casket rolls `rolls` [min, max] times on `common` (weighted), then `supplies.rolls` times on `supplies` (runes, herbs and bones: the hard-earned piles, more for harder trails), then once at 1 in `rare.chance` on `rare.table` (weighted, one item). amount is a number or [min, max]. unique: the player can own only one (inventory or bank); a held unique is left out of the roll. Certificates stand in for noted items (RSC has no notes); herbs and bones have none, so a casket puts what the inventory cannot hold into the bank.",
